    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303440/extras/6fd6390710e9a5d78f0e4f817c2a4e04.poster.avif?t=1749042395\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303440/extras/6fd6390710e9a5d78f0e4f817c2a4e04.webm?t=1749042395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303440/extras/6fd6390710e9a5d78f0e4f817c2a4e04.mp4?t=1749042395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In this farming tycoon game, you will have to build and develop your base on the red planet and provide the Martian colony with supplies. Take up digging, building and mining to build your industrial empire there!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303440/extras/e081e7222c05da034ecab4c895c58254.poster.avif?t=1749042395\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303440/extras/e081e7222c05da034ecab4c895c58254.webm?t=1749042395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303440/extras/e081e7222c05da034ecab4c895c58254.mp4?t=1749042395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Adapt to surviving in extreme conditions, earn passive income and build your farming Empire on Mars! Become the first space millionaire!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303440/extras/bbc05ffe5496cd0ac8dc3807aaa6eef2.avif?t=1749042395\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2>- Automate work at the farm by using robots, and earn income even when the game is off;<br>- Upgrade the greenhouses, Mars Rover and space base to improve business efficiency;<br>- Grow various crops and provide the inhabitants of the planet with the necessary supplies;<br>- Complete various tasks and get rewards;<br>- Invest wisely by making well-weighed business decisions;<br>- Make friends with an adorable dog named Cookie! <br>- Enjoy the incredible landscapes of Mars.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303440/extras/71f530d3e5cf914ecdd04daa10266df7.avif?t=1749042395\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303440/extras/6fd6390710e9a5d78f0e4f817c2a4e04.poster.avif?t=1749042395\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303440/extras/6fd6390710e9a5d78f0e4f817c2a4e04.webm?t=1749042395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303440/extras/6fd6390710e9a5d78f0e4f817c2a4e04.mp4?t=1749042395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In this farming tycoon game, you will have to build and develop your base on the red planet and provide the Martian colony with supplies. Take up digging, building and mining to build your industrial empire there!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303440/extras/e081e7222c05da034ecab4c895c58254.poster.avif?t=1749042395\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303440/extras/e081e7222c05da034ecab4c895c58254.webm?t=1749042395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303440/extras/e081e7222c05da034ecab4c895c58254.mp4?t=1749042395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Adapt to surviving in extreme conditions, earn passive income and build your farming Empire on Mars! Become the first space millionaire!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303440/extras/bbc05ffe5496cd0ac8dc3807aaa6eef2.avif?t=1749042395\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2>- Automate work at the farm by using robots, and earn income even when the game is off;<br>- Upgrade the greenhouses, Mars Rover and space base to improve business efficiency;<br>- Grow various crops and provide the inhabitants of the planet with the necessary supplies;<br>- Complete various tasks and get rewards;<br>- Invest wisely by making well-weighed business decisions;<br>- Make friends with an adorable dog named Cookie! <br>- Enjoy the incredible landscapes of Mars.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303440/extras/71f530d3e5cf914ecdd04daa10266df7.avif?t=1749042395\" /></span>",
    "short_description": "Idle Mars Colony is a simulator game of the clicker genre, where you can try your hand at being the owner of a space farm. It combines the best aspects of idle tycoon games and farming games. Earn money, automate the work and enjoy the exciting gameplay!",
